# Build and test tools for the Transcribe.exe launcher, top-level pins. Edit this
# file, then regenerate the hashed lock that build.cmd installs (see the command at
# the top of requirements-build.lock).
#
# pywebview and its dependencies end up inside the exe; PyInstaller and pytest do
# not (Transcribe.spec fails the build if a build-only module is bundled).

